<title>Ecuador's security crisis: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ecuador/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ecuador-2026-11-24T14:02:19.642Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:02:19 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;US forces have begun a land operation against cartels inside Ecuador while expanding military activities across Latin America. President Noboa asked the United States for $430.5 billion in security aid, met with Pete Hegseth on anti-narco cooperation, and rejected claims that former vice president Jorge Glas was tortured, saying his injuries were self-inflicted. Journalist Omar Toledo, who denounced local corruption, was shot by motorcycle gunmen. A fugitive Ecuadorian gang boss known as Commander Willy was arrested at a hotel in Sitges and deported from Spain, and a top drug gang leader arrived in Ecuador after deportation from Spain. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTFBGdVhKVFZZejdkUjhLY2xPUzRsMDNxYnE4ZDkta0FVd1R2Y1Y0V2ROU2U3ejh0ODI5NHA3Z2xoN1JYTmhLaGdhNGdaLVVjdGVyOG1iM3hMVTk?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxQRklvWklPTVl3ME52SnA0NF9YcmItc2xHeTRseGJydXJFUHo4c2NBcVZnRXlTYmRGVUlEdVlkNHVzUlgwM0NNaV9TcWNJTE5ZTlRkVUo4ZWpDY1Yxb25LU0JySndreUV4V3ZYejlUTnJsZDVqUzhMbk4xZUpjOGFoSUoxSUdiV3U0N2hjQU9abTdXOWx3d0xV?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNS0J3akM1b0FNdUdUam1iZm1TNzZ5dEswSFlLVUUyMXFmR0hDa2NZRk9sZHJzWUpDWmZYZ3M4a283MEd5WGhyMHZIWVFTZHl3czRydXVERFNZaUJ4MzNIXzM4dFNwUm1qVGdFQ3JyMVlmcnBKR2hfU1BQb1pJTDg2bzFmcVFTUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxPQUVYR1FybjhBel9YLVpVZjdOUU5UWGR0YXIwbTBDS0M2NW9LVklQdnA2VUNCRjkzbXdZRXNuYTVwcFdWM2N0VFZwSWhRZEx5VnNhVmtUeXc5RloyOUUwVmJzRTQtNDdFeDNGNFdxb0ttQUJtUHlHS1ZJVXJ1bmtXWnkzMGFXakZJU2hzbm9XSE40